stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> completed : money RPC commits (transfer, deposit, withdrawal, bill, adjustment)
  completed --> reversed : admin_reverse_transaction (new reversal row created)
  reversed --> [*]
  completed --> [*]
  note right of completed
    'pending' and 'failed' are allowed by the CHECK constraint
    but no function writes them; a failed RPC rolls back entirely.
  end note
